{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000135_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000135_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9585d199e7fdcdfc3ca5423e6fd4fb53ea8881524921683a9bc1ff1866570e60", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 45, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да. Точно.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000136_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000136_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:fea765691b1dd891632b4d5872abb837c450d5502e3de3ed524a4543a1207ad9", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 46, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я всё же пытаюсь улыбнуться, хоть и выходит неловко.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000155_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000155_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:66eabff7101ec0c90e93990f6a199c2f3ea66d3ef577cf40125f326e2b791d7b", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 47, "speaker": null, "translation": "Тем же вечером —", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000162_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000162_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:43d2b126c698fc10b21d2ffa54efbb3ceec4f9e2f3c2d7e1fc8abd55bf094606", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 48, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мы с Инари отправляемся в горы.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000163_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000163_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:65e61a3af54efda25738bd132ba861a2bcad9fd70620d15fcbe8f5b67c65909b", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 49, "speaker": null, "translation": "Подвесной фонарь, которым пользовались во время горного обряда, нужно оставить в святилище в качестве подношения.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000164_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000164_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2cbc76b0fbc7a15a037ceaab63ad1e1f2d3bd20d3a6877f2ebe2c65b9fd16645", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 50, "speaker": null, "translation": "Когда нашли ситиейтё Аи, подвесной фонарь принесли в палату и с тех пор не трогали.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000165_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000165_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ea834fe0946aa28aedb942fc82af014c299535a3d610013c0f382dd3e5c4fe8c", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 51, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я иду по горной тропе вслед за Инари.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000183_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000183_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:16ae8c50b87971bbc3cc7fb4e337c5f3f434892c40765cf2ea0131e781a8aa19", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 52, "speaker": null, "translation": "По дороге Инари находит ситиейтё.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000184_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000184_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:fb2ba4dcbd5dd43aac3ddd8f21df2487ee2b8093cdc367a7ff2399a92883bef7", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 53, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я пробую поднять подвесной фонарь, будто подзывая бабочку, и она сразу подлетает.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000202_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000202_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2d4327b13ced17a4c3de8bc8a9e4a4a08535d1ac2babb944e6182ba493572997", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 54, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Хм-м, значит, даже я могу направлять ситиейтё.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000203_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000203_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4b14c57a6572def6ebdf294b6d8dd670a2386c6e86fbc735ba6679deb44653d1", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 55, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мне, в отличие от Ао, даже не приходится к ней прикасаться.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000204_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000204_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5a266e4d7e5b1af2c1e2c21340908cca3222af3e407e425ba9bfb4dd5d08f423", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 56, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Теперь просто довести её до священного древа, да?", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000205_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000205_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:457de1cdf450be2dcf341d3f778186074ba13d1606a78e91e43efcdfd9f2ea09", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 57, "speaker": null, "translation": "Наверное, горный обряд и был задуман именно так.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000206_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000206_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bad96e175d40c2f1c27017ddbd308c2733282fec75b54b3552afe21eaee233b9", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 58, "speaker": null, "translation": "Похоже, так и следует делать.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000211_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000211_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1ed0cdf84c8094e38584a26533bcf57b77e7dad617a3ad97d057485295380aa6", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 59, "speaker": "イナリ", "translation": "Пон.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000212_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000212_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:03560807ae2e7fdc4ad14cff83630ba5b4c0605b41c0ca211ed6e736b83c0b29", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 60, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да, идём.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000238_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000238_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c3bea32be65ffe1dbad5ae367bffc1a1485efe20b39539aba3d3b73651bb89f1", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 61, "speaker": null, "translation": "В итоге я привожу сюда двух ситиейтё.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000239_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000239_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:419edb1f53f2a7e404983b94cffad9d1a8567b28444fbc09353c23eae57792d8", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 62, "speaker": null, "translation": "Убедившись, что обе бабочки перелетели к священному древу, я ставлю подвесной фонарь в святилище.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000253_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000253_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:581f44e2beb1eea35ebf55d1fe1e4ee6e08304fa92f3bd7de04e4556330bf286", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 63, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Ну вот, готово.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000254_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000254_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ac13b657bf85b3dc57969f403003a881810090a703afbdada50128a5c57452b5", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 64, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я снова смотрю на священное древо.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000270_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000270_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d5432687943be884c334551b2af42016cdff35dbd8325c05fabbd7fe2d084385", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 65, "speaker": null, "translation": "Ситиейтё всё ещё порхают вокруг священного древа.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000271_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000271_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9990faf3d00cb8b0aaf2513a9cfabec341c1e7e8b3373a5818e78daca93c4d81", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 66, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Что?..", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000272_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000272_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4b895b200fe900abdf43803a9f21e1a3ce50e7f1f7524291860f0e43ff99d32b", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 67, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Цветы… почти все осыпались…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000290_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000290_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d5dd27ba74efa984534b9b304e0e270631e2f1796fad3f28b9b85c12a953e827", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 68, "speaker": null, "translation": "На земле лежит множество мелких белых цветов Татибаны заблудших.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000291_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000291_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bc99da12e15c399bbae7291dd04446cd255cf3b8e78b7c85a3c3239cfdb55379", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 69, "speaker": null, "translation": "Ао говорила, что горный обряд длится лишь пока цветёт Татибана заблудших.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000292_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000292_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a92daa1f0a84059a6d24909ce6e3ea9ec9df0c74c547168f9b1a05db3df0ba98", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 70, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Скоро всё закончится…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000293_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000293_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8bbe53241d17dc54106f1e18aaf93bf3abbc4b4ca82639a3710054f2035cbc69", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 71, "speaker": null, "translation": "И дело не только в обряде.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000294_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000294_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7378ddabc8f8c18adf5ef86a5d54a568ba7797494e8a71fc1b38291d31639df0", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 72, "speaker": null, "translation": "Летние каникулы тоже подходят к концу.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000295_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000295_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2043a2c671d92827073ac6eefde41bc337b7a2b3ecd014b56cf7341f07356483", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 73, "speaker": null, "translation": "…Когда каникулы закончатся, мне придётся вернуться домой.", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000296_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000296_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9065f2738e4b5f2841a2851c8b3b6e32c6c34d265a416b868aad0aaaf261f84b", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 74, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мне придётся уехать… с острова…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000306_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000306_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:84f30f2fe040e3f61a530fae9414c8a7a4dfa766245176c9bb8ddc30b1345dfe", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 75, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Ты ведь проснёшься до этого, Ао…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0128_R000307_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000133_R000307_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:33e5f2e204c9eb9c53d20a3cf2abd34a18eae0a2d8a7b93c3969dd72e2a1d2a9", "file_id": "S0128", "scene_id": "SCN0102", "order": 76, "speaker": null, "translation": "В небе надо мной лишь тихо сияет луна…", "status": "reviewed", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
